<section aria-labelledby="discovery-faq-title" class="discovery-faq"><div class="discovery-faq-intro"><p class="eyebrow light" data-t="faqKicker">BEFORE YOU DECIDE</p><h3 data-t="faqTitle" id="discovery-faq-title">Questions worth asking first</h3><p data-t="faqLead">A discovery conversation does not obligate you to begin a coaching program.</p></div><div class="faq-items">
<details class="faq-item"><summary data-t="faqQ1">Are coaching conversations confidential?</summary><p data-t="faqA1">Yes. In organizational engagements, goals and ways to review progress are agreed, but the content of individual coaching conversations is not reported to the sponsor.</p></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary data-t="faqQ2">How do I know whether coaching fits this situation?</summary><p data-t="faqA2">Discovery helps clarify the situation and intended outcomes. If the issue calls for expert recommendations rather than coaching, advisory work may be a better fit. Any change in role requires explicit agreement.</p></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary data-t="faqQ3">What happens after the discovery conversation?</summary><p data-t="faqA3">If it makes sense to continue, we agree on the focus, session format, responsibilities and fees in a clear proposal. Booking a discovery conversation does not commit you to a coaching package.</p></details>
</div></section>
</div></section><section class="last-invite"><div class="wrap invite-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span><span data-t="lastOverline">ONE PRACTICAL FIRST STEP</span></p><h2 data-thtml="lastHeading">We do not need<br/><em>all the answers yet.</em></h2><p data-t="lastLead">We can begin with a discovery conversation and explore whether coaching would be an appropriate way forward.</p></div><a aria-label="Book a 30-minute discovery conversation" class="button-main button-cream" data-booking="true" data-entry="closing" href="https://calendly.com/mehdi-nezhadrasouli/30min" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span data-t="lastBook">Start a 30-minute conversation</span><span class="button-arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
